fit.const 25 7586.8 7694.3 138.607     31.536 0.41408       1  1.958e-08 ***
---
Signif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1
